Package: taskforest
Version: __VERSION__
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Depends: fontconfig, libfreetype6, libxkbcommon0, libwayland-client0, libvulkan1
Recommends: polkitd
Suggests: smartmontools, nvme-cli, xfsprogs, iw, mesa-vulkan-drivers, nvidia-vulkan-icd
Maintainer: TaskForest contributors <noreply@yellowwhiteblackcat.github.io>
Installed-Size: __INSTALLED_SIZE__
Homepage: https://github.com/YellowWhiteBlackCat/TaskForest
Description: Eye-friendly native system monitor built with GPUI
 TaskForest renders live CPU, memory, GPU, network, storage, and per-process
 telemetry through one Wayland-native GPUI frontend. This package installs the
 GPUI application and the per-feature polkit-gated helpers (ADR-023): nothing
 runs privileged until an OS-native prompt authorizes it. History is persisted
 by the active frontend session.
 .
 Wayland session required (X11 is not supported). Vulkan loader and a Vulkan
 ICD for your GPU are needed for rendering; the suggested packages cover the
 common cases.
